igned policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n### Workshop station 4\nA capture date can precede a policy amendment. The board's operative schedule governs the stated evaluation date, while the age of the log is computed from its capture date.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Archive's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n### Workshop station 5\nA reference card had an unlabeled number of days. The archivist required the class label and authority interval to be copied with a retention value to prevent scope loss.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Archive's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n### Workshop station 6\nA discussion of releasing a hold was kept as correspondence. The archivist did not silently convert a proposed release into a signed release, or an incomplete packet into a complete register.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Archive's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n---\nSigned operative block\n\nHold register extract certified complete for Tidal Archive log L-004 as of 2026-10-13. Capture date: 2026-08-01. Archive board hold H-004 is active and expressly names this raw log. It expires only on a signed release; no release is registered. The log's age exceeds the operative revised retention period.\n\nSOURCE {\"aliases\":[\"Juniper Capsule\",\"Juniper Capsule capsule\",\"Juniper Capsule custody\"],\"authored_at\":\"2026-06-15T09:00:00Z\",\"chars\":[0,235],\"id\":\"N065-R010\",\"incorporates\":[],\"kind\":\"source\",\"links\":[],\"revision\":1,\"scope\":\"N065\",\"supersedes\":[],\"title\":\"Juniper Capsule baseline\"}\