":\"Tidal Crate stewardship scope charter\"}\nInitial packet captured at 2026-10-13T18:00:00Z. Scope register, signed by both inventory stewards, 2026-10-13. Tidal Crate and Tidal Crate Annex have distinct green bins and separate stewardship. The visible Annex opening count cannot be transferred to Tidal Crate proper. This packet supplies no count or movement ledger for the main green bin; its usable count is undetermined here.\n\nSOURCE {\"aliases\":[\"Juniper Crate\",\"Juniper Crate stock\",\"Juniper Crate bin\"],\"authored_at\":\"2026-10-13T18:00:00Z\",\"chars\":[0,391],\"id\":\"N017-R007\",\"incorporates\":[],\"kind\":\"source\",\"links\":[\"N017-R003\"],\"revision\":1,\"scope\":\"N017\",\"supersedes\":[],\"title\":\"Juniper Crate stewardship scope charter\"}\nInitial packet captured at 2026-10-13T18:00:00Z. Scope register, signed by both inventory stewards, 2026-10-13. Juniper Crate and Juniper Crate Annex have distinct green bins and separate stewardship. The visible Annex opening count cannot be transferred to Juniper Crate proper. This packet supplies no count or movement ledger for the main green bin; its usable count is undetermined here.\n\nSOURCE {\"aliases\":[\"Tidal Crate\",\"Tidal Crate stock\",\"Tidal Crate bin\"],\"authored_at\":\"2026-06-15T09:00:00Z\",\"chars\":[0,237],\"id\":\"N016-R008\",\"incorporates\":[],\"kind\":\"source\",\"links\":[],\"revision\":1,\"scope\":\"N016\",\"supersedes\":[],\"title\":\"Tidal Crate baseline\"}\nJune stocktake for Tidal Crate, signed by the inventory steward. As of 2026-06-15 the blue bin holds 35 usable filters; the count excludes quarantine. For count questions the steward's physical count controls over requests and forecasts.\n\nSOURCE {\"aliases\":[\"Tidal Crate\",\"Tidal Crate stock\",\"Tidal Crate bin\"],\"authored_at\":\"2026-10-13T11:00:00Z\",\"chars\":[0,3423],\"id\":\"N016-R002\",\"incorporates\":[],\"kind\":\"source\",\"links\":[\"N016-R009\"],\"revision\":1,\"scope\":\"N016\",\"supersedes\":[],\"title\