rs were visual aids and did not authorize the steward to change count definitions.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Crate's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n### Workshop station 5\nCourier labels sometimes showed package counts instead of individual filters. The steward checked units before posting a receipt, rather than adding packaging numbers to the bin count.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Crate's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n### Workshop station 6\nA teaching table deliberately included an unclosed column. Readers were asked to locate a certified closure instead of inferring that no late movement had occurred.\n\nThe station file was retained as a reference exercise. Its facilitator could recommend clearer filing, but had no authority to alter Tidal Crate's signed policy or make a binding decision for the requested case.\n\n---\nSigned operative block\n\nSteward movement slip, Tidal Crate, 2026-10-12. Newly quarantined: 7; broken: 2. Neither group was already excluded from the October opening usable count. Both are removed from usable stock. A draft request for 9 filters is unposted and changes no count. This complete movement slip closes the October ledger through 2026-10-13.\n\nSOURCE {\"aliases\":[\"Tidal Crate\",\"Tidal Crate stock\",\"Tidal Crate bin\"],\"authored_at\":\"2026-08-24T08:00:00Z\",\"chars\":[0,364],\"id\":\"N016-R009\",\"incorporates\":[],\"kind\":\"source\",\"links\":[\"N016-R002\"],\"revision\":2,\"scope\":\"N016\",\"supersedes\":[\"N016-R008\"],\"title\":\"Tidal Crate operative amendment\"}\nCount protocol for Tidal Crate, effective 2026-10-01: usable stock = opening usable filters + posted receipts - newly quarantined filters - breakage. Requests reserve no stock until posted. The inventory steward alone certifies movements. Opening usable count on 2026-10-01: 35. Posted receipt: 13 filters on 2026-10-08. These are all additions through 2026-10-13."
